    s1H: 'Why we are open about this',
    s1P: [
      'A brand that uses AI and hides it has a problem the moment somebody notices. A brand that simply says so has a story: no samples flying around the world, no shoot booked three weeks ahead, no crew of eight for twelve products.',
      'The disclosure costs you nothing. Its absence can cost you a customer.',
    ],

    s2H: 'What these rules are aimed at',
    s2P: [
