      'Which is why we work the way we do:',
    ],
    s4Items: [
      ['Real photographs of the front and the back are both required.', 'We do not invent your product, we re-photograph it — and a catalog set delivers a back image, so we ask for the back rather than guess at a print or a seam you cannot see from the front.'],
